ep 2026 19:07:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/hitler-had-an-intense-mysterious-relationship-with-his-half-niece-new-research-suggests-his-alibi-for-her-murder-might-not-hold-up-180989572/</guid></item><item><title>澳大利亚发现了两种新的竹节虫物种，另一种则隐藏在众目睽睽之下</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/two-new-stick-insect-species-have-been-discovered-in-australiaand-another-one-was-hiding-in-plain-sight-180989575/</link><description>新发现强调，即使在有大量观测的地区，科学家们对于昆虫多样性还有很多需要了解的地方</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:03:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/two-new-stick-insect-species-have-been-discovered-in-australiaand-another-one-was-hiding-in-plain-sight-180989575/</guid></item><item><title>科学家发明了一种可消化的纸基电池，可为吞咽或植入的医疗设备供电</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/scientists-invent-a-digestible-paper-based-battery-that-can-power-swallowed-or-implanted-medical-devices-180989549/</link><description>到目前为止，该技术仅在猪身上进行了测试。如果它在人类身上取得成功，有一天它可能会成为监测您健康状况或在体内输送药物或电流的电动工具</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 18:37:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/scientists-invent-a-digestible-paper-based-battery-that-can-power-swallowed-or-implanted-medical-devices-180989549/</guid></item><item><title>两千多年前，朱利叶斯·凯撒征服了最终成为巴黎的定居点。考古学家可能刚刚发现它</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/two-thousand-years-ago-julius-caesar-conquered-the-settlement-that-eventually-became-paris-archaeologists-may-have-just-found-it-180989569/</link><description>在塞纳河西岱岛的一家医院进行挖掘时，研究人员发现了可能曾经保护过卢泰西亚（法国首都的高卢前身）的城墙的一部分</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/two-thousand-years-ago-julius-caesar-conquered-the-settlement-that-eventually-became-paris-archaeologists-may-have-just-found-it-180989569/</guid></item><item><title>蝙蝠起源于哪里？大规模的基因研究可能解决了长期存在的争论并改写了生物的进化树</title